{C:81932300}{C:81958296310000000000}I wouldn't know!
I only just got here!!

{x00}

{C:81931C00}{C:81958296DA2100000000}All that effort... all that effort...
Then I'll kill you!!

{x00}

{C:81930300}{C:81958296E52100000000}I'm Rie Akatsuki,
captain of the Astante.

{x00}

{C:81930100}{C:819582965B2200000000}Yeah, I understand.
I'll be right there.





{x00}

{C:81932300}{C:81958296380000000000}You're always the ones
who attack first!

{x00}

{C:81932700}{C:819582966D2200000000}What the hell are you babbling about?!
Sho!


{x00}

{C:81902700}{C:819582969E2200000000}Flying a machine I'm not used to is tiring.
I'm going to get some rest right away.


{x00}

{C:81902300}{C:81958296440000000000}I'm sure they came this way.
Are they going to see Drake directly?



{x00}

{C:81932700}{C:81958296A62200000000}There you are, Zelerna!
Bring Sho out, damn you!

{x00}

{C:81931E00}{C:81958296A72200000000}Sho?!
I don't know anyone by that name.

{x00}

{C:81932700}{C:81958296A82200000000}You bastards
are hiding him, aren't you?!



{x00}

{C:81932600}{C:81958296CC2200000000}I'm sorry I can't do anything, young people.
I wish you victory in battle.



{x00}

{C:81930400}{C:81958296D22200000000}Nie and the others are waiting.
Let's go to the Kingdom of Lau.


{x00}

{C:81932700}{C:81958296F02200000000}You're persistent.
People don't like that, you know.


{x00}
